Desperately trying to break free, you reach for a hand-made machete in your bag, but the dreadful branches surround you from all sides, making every new movement increasingly difficult. Soon, your arms and legs are tightly ensnared by the plant.
The patches of skin uncovered by clothing begin to burn. Initially, it's just a little discomfort, but soon the burning pain becomes intolerable. The wind muffles your weak cries for help, and before long, your body hangs upon the predatory branches, which greedily drain your life. Your adventure ends here.